{"id":231,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Phanpy uses its long nose to shower itself. When others gather around, they thoroughly douse each other with water. These Pokémon can be seen drying their soaking-wet bodies at the edge of water."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"For its nest, Phanpy digs a vertical pit in the ground at the edge of a river. It marks the area around its nest with its trunk to let the others know that the area has been claimed."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, that can be dangerous."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, this can be dangerous."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"PHANPY’s big ears serve as broad fans. When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears busily to cool down. Even the young are very strong."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"During the deserted morning hours, it comes ashore where it deftly uses its trunk to take a shower."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pickup","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may pick up an item another Pokémon used during a battle. It may pick up items outside of battle, too."},{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Blue","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":231,"name":"Phanpy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":232,"name":"Donphan","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level"